.TH SERVCTL 1 "26 March 2026" "v0.1.0-alpha2" "servctl"
.SH NAME
servctl \- Control the raesir init system
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B servctl
[\fICOMMAND\fR] [\fISERVICE\fR...]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B servctl
is the command-line interface for managing services in the \fBraesir\fR system.
It communicates with PID 1 via \fB/run/raesir.sock\fR.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B status
Displays the general status of the raesir process.
.TP
.B list
Lists all currently loaded and running services.
.TP
.B start \fISERVICE\fR
Starts the specified service.
.TP
.B stop \fISERVICE\fR
Stops the specified service.
.TP
.B restart \fISERVICE\fR
Restarts the specified service.
.SH FILES
.TP
\fB/run/raesir.sock\fR
The Unix domain socket used for communication with \fBraesir\fR.
.SH AUTHOR
AnmiTaliDev <anmitalidev@nuros.org>
.SH "SEE ALSO"
.BR raesir (1)
